<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Home - Product</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Financial Management Professionals">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.pigroup.com/en/product">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Home - Product">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Financial Management Professionals">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.pigroup.com/en/product">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.pigroup.com/assets/images/og-image.jpg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/main.css">
    <script type="module" src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
    <script src="assets/js/menu.js" defer></script>
    <script src="assets/js/language-switcher.js" defer></script>
    </head>
<body class="product-page">
    <header id="site-header" class="">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header-content">
                <!-- Mobile menu toggle button for screens < 768px -->
                <button class="mobile-menu-toggle" 
                    aria-label="Toggle navigation menu" 
                    aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="menu-icon">
                        <span class="bar"></span>
                        <span class="bar"></span>
                        <span class="bar"></span>
                    </span>
                </button>
                
                <!-- Section 1: Logo & Group name -->
                <div class="logo-section">
                    <a href="?page=home&lang=en" class="logo-link">
                        <div class="logo-container">
                            <img src="assets/images/logo_small.svg" alt="PI Group Logo">
                            <span class="group-name">PI Group</span>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Section 2: Main Navigation Menu -->
                <nav class="main-nav">
                    <ul>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=home&lang=en">
                                Home                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=segment&id=investment_banking&lang=en">
                                Investment Banking                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=segment&id=asset_management&lang=en">
                                Asset Management                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=our-team&lang=en">
                                Our Team                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=about&lang=en">
                                About Us                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=contact&lang=en">
                                Contact Us                            </a>
                        </li>
                                            </ul>
                </nav>
                
                <!-- Section 3: Language Switcher -->
                <div class="language-switcher">
                                        <a href="?page=product&id=pi_select&lang=en" class="lang-switch active" data-lang="en">EN</a>
                    <span class="separator">|</span>
                    <a href="?page=product&id=pi_select&lang=he" class="lang-switch " data-lang="he">עב</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>
    <main id="main-content">


<section class="product">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="product-header">
                            <div class="product-logo">
                    <img src="assets/images/investment_banking/pi_select/logo_large.svg" alt="PI Select">
                </div>
                        <div class="product-title">
                <h1>PI Select</h1>
                                    <p class="product-slogan">Invest With Confidence</p>
                            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="product-description">
            For over three decades, Pi has been fortunate to participate in many of Israel's most promising investment opportunities—spanning private and public companies, managed funds, and real estate. In partnership with our longtime friend and esteemed commercial lawyer, Buky Katzman, we have launched Pi Select—a boutique platform designed to offer select foreign investors the opportunity to co-invest alongside us in high-potential Israeli ventures. We are excited to share our insights, experience, and network with like-minded investors who see the unique opportunities Israel has to offer.        </div>

                    <h2 class="section-title">Founders</h2>
            <div class="team-grid founders-grid">
                                                        <a href="?page=team-member&id=buky-katzman&lang=en" class="card-link">
                        <div class="team-card founder-card">
                                                            <img src="assets/images/team/buky_katzman.png" alt="Baruch (Buky) Katzman">
                                                        <div class="team-info">
                                <h3>Baruch (Buky) Katzman</h3>
                                <p>Co-founder</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                            </div>
        
            </div>
</section>

</main>
    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-content">
                <div class="footer-logo">
                    <img src="assets/images/logo.svg" alt="PI Group Logo">
                    <p class="footer-text">PI Group Financial Services</p>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <ul>
                                            </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-social">
                    <!-- Add social media links here -->
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>&copy; 2025 PI Group. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>

